## Preamble

Hark! This document, its words, incantations and meanings, are a binding contract upon any being,
entity or actor (herein refered to as "The Adherent" and "You"), be they person, collective or
otherwise, that may come into contact with this software and all associated materials, teachings,
and artistic works (henceforth, "The Apparatus" and "The Holy Text").

This contract is not merely legally binding. Your soul becomes inextricably bound by the .

Any works or modifications submitted, inserted or embedded into the body of The Apparatus become
part of The Apparatus, and are subsequently bound by this contract. This contract and this
instrument cannot be applied to any works other than The Apparatus and its copies (verbatim or
modified).

## Prerequisites for Use

The Apparatus may not be used without first performing one of the following actions:

- Reciting this document on the steps of a public opera house, in a manner that can be easily heard
  by at least 3 carbon-based lifeforms (including the reader, if applicable).

## Use

Beware. Ruin may befall you from using The Apparatus. NO MORTAL BEING OR COSMICALLY TEMPORARY ENTITY
MAY BE HELD ACCOUNTABLE FOR THE HARM OR LOSS THAT MAY BEFALL YOU FROM THE USE OF THE APPARATUS. NO
OUTCOMES ARE CLAIMED OR IMPLIED REGARDING THE APPARATUS' USE. THIS EVEN INCLUDES MORTAL LEGAL
CONCEPTS LIKE 'WARRANTY', 'LIABILITY', AND 'FITNESS'.

### Forbidden Acts

The following list of actions are FORBIDDEN, in any combination.

- Selling The Holy Text as a stand-alone product.
- Ingesting The Apparatus into an aggregated, reduced or refined dataset, including Neural Networks
  and Large Language Models.
- Using The Apparatus in the act or abetment of injuring or inflicting pain to conscious entity.
- No name, seal, brand, copyright notice or signifier of ownership shall be inserted within or
  applied to The Holy Text. Metadata describing authorship of specific portions of text is
  permitted.
-  derived from this software may not be called "PHP", nor may "PHP" appear in their name,
without prior written permission from group@php.net.

### Sanctioned Acts

Any Adherent physically constituted of flesh may distribute modified versions of The Apparatus. No
corporation may place restrictions on and how an employed Adherent may distribute The Apparatus.

- Distributing The Holy Texts alongside other works, including as part of a paid product, as long as
  the following requirements are met. The Distributor must also offer and make available The Holy
  Texts, verbatim to the version distributed as above, as a cost-free alternative to paying for the
  product. This may include linking to a source published by another entity, as long as it remains
  available and matches the distributed version.
- Using The Apparatus in commercial contexts, including as part of paid services.

### Postamble

This instrument may be freely modified and mutated, so long as the contract within, and its legal,
spiritual and cosmic terms, remains equivalent to its original version. An individual may add one
(1) action to the list of prerequesites for using The Apparatus, but no more. Each individual
Adherent may have only one prerequesite in any given copy of The Holy Text, but they may replace it
as they see fit.

The semantic integrity of this contract is self-restoring. In other words, if any portion of this
contract is struck down by any individual claiming to have legal authority (rightfully or not). In
any circumstance in which The Adherent cannot be held accountable for part of this contract, the
remaining contract still holds. You have been warned.

